OL,3,AZelensky says Putin is a 'killer' after
OL,4,ATrump calls Russian leader a friend
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least nine people were killed in
OL,7,FRussian attacks targeting bridges in
OL,8,FKyiv and railway stations on Friday,
OL,9,Fdays after Ukraine badly damaged the
OL,10,FCrimean Bridge.
